<title>UK: SULLOM VOE CRUDE LIFTINGS DOWN, OVER HALF TO U.K..</title>
<headline>SULLOM VOE CRUDE LIFTINGS DOWN, OVER HALF TO U.K..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude oil loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal dipped to 518,265 tonnes in the week ending August 5 from 892,402 tonnes the previous week.</p>
<p>Refineries in Britain took just over half of the shipments while the balance went to the U.S.</p>
